      "text": "Expenditures for out-of-town travel are not to exceed the appropriation in Code 405. Form 1-2 must be completed for every trip, and, in a case where the Director of Management and Budget must approve a trip, the form is to arrive at his office not later than two weeks prior to the start of the trip.",
